72
00:11:31,261 --> 00:11:32,681
Oh, that's right.

73
00:11:32,981 --> 00:11:34,281
How did your match go, Ray?

74
00:11:35,001 --> 00:11:36,501
I sure hope it went well.

75
00:11:37,101 --> 00:11:39,141
