76
00:11:42,461 --> 00:11:42,941
So...

77
00:11:42,941 --> 00:11:44,101
I won.

78
00:11:45,701 --> 00:11:46,501
That's great!

79
00:11:46,921 --> 00:11:47,861
I'm so glad!

80
00:11:48,501 --> 00:11:50,921
Feed us! Feed us! We want food!

81
00:11:52,741 --> 00:11:53,801
